# What the serverless function does NOT need.
#
# Git-based deploys only ever ship tracked files, so this file exists for
# `vercel deploy` from a working copy — which ignores .gitignore and would
# otherwise upload both .exe builds, dist/, release/ and your local library:
# 327MB of widget for a server that uses none of it.
#
# It also keeps the lambda small. The function needs api/, server/ and
# static/ (Flask serves the fonts and the stylesheet itself) and nothing else.

# the Windows widget and everything used to build it
*.exe
*.zip
*.ico
build/
dist/
release/
installer.iss
noskips.spec
scripts/
assets/

# your library — ratings and cached artwork stay on your machine
data/
covers/
*.db

# development only
tests/
docs/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
.github/
.env*
